    "body": "FWIW I am also a fan of removing this. One big consumer of it at the moment is [#updating-the-image-data](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#updating-the-image-data), and in #3752 we're probably going to stop referencing it, because it expects to be called from an in-parallel context (and it is likely that we're going to clarify this algorithm [should not be called](https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/3752#discussion_r303769255) in-parallel).",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
